    <p>Failing your final inspection is one of the most stressful — and expensive — experiences a Melbourne renter can have. The good news is that property managers and real estate agents use a consistent checklist. Know what's on that checklist and you know exactly what to clean.</p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <p><strong>From our experience across 12,000+ cleans:</strong> The kitchen and bathroom together account for the vast majority of re-clean requests. If you only have limited time, that is where to focus first. Items marked 🔴 HOT are the most commonly failed.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>The REIV-Aligned <em>Inspection Checklist</em></h2>
    <p>The Real Estate Institute of Victoria (REIV) provides a standard inspection checklist used by most Melbourne property managers. Here is the full checklist, room by room.</p>

